# Multimedia Communications: An Update on Standards.

**Authors:** Galbreath, Jeremy

## Abstract
Provides an update on the standards that are governing digital multimedia technology. Highlights include symmetrical multimedia standards that include a variety of compression and transmission schemes; asymmetrical multimedia standards that includes compressed digital motion video and still images; applications sharing; networks; and the Internet. (Author/LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ541445

